{"summary":"Trapped in a dark realm, fight to survive an ancient African ritual.","description":"A dark history comes calling in this intense fusion of survival-horror gameplay, Souls-like combat, and African mythology. Explore an atmospheric, story-driven shooter where you play as Bolanle Gboyega, a soldier on the run from insurgents who mysteriously finds herself in the Realm of Tribulations, a haunting supernatural realm steeped in ancient power. Her only way home lies in undergoing an ancient ritual… or so she believes.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n- Touchscreen and controller support.\n- Explore and uncover the mystery of the Realm of Tribulations.\n- Engage ferocious enemies in intense battles.\n- Meet various characters in voiced dialog sequences.\n- Solve riddles to advance your trials.\n- Use powerful charms to aid in combat.\n- Upgrade your characters features and equipment.\n- Utilize night vision googles when it gets dark.\n- Navigate the Realm through teleportation portals.\n- Premium Package: offline, no ads, no In-app purchases","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Strong Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WVkumJgkROs?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S8Fq03fuHjKMrpqP2uIwZ5pUcHT9CDu0Pv-QAPs4wyrccFkM_Y7RfWGkVOZMyGdyrCXed5dsdpLkdaTI9Duw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rlVv9aHmUZFURkOCdab6zCUcay-rzUEzpiXWDFXD5Tdcu98MPVySq0yU1HrN-u1h060AZ_F1ptvHw1a2U90m","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HOGFFpwHpUYjpqH2AcXHrUp7Top-vtLabAYrEjVINzp7O4sgm66sBfIYIyWzscGpNCzRc6nuxip104ujbGvg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jvjBzgei64WKRsbbrSmcL8OGBR0KMmt0kk9PQNMkjpGdgEehCm7cVW_5VAWNV-wk34-6Zu8Qvn5_tjhgy4-9","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KXVbuGNaIot1gmkrYxeLTQec4kSTiclpbSXc2mRvjjReR6uzTDCcEN57xrPWQ8lFGG1-CLpLzllSb6nyCin8F38","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Vu7TVitXCMSil4ocD5-wQhP5XHhpWiySMvkoXzFksv8QHKvs_LRMfI2kWAjMmbKTNZRvsvZdQzslSspwOVZX","https:/